Using Google Hacking Database (GHDB), I performed two reconnaissance tasks:
Task 1 – Exposed Security Cameras
Using dorks like intitle:"webcamXP" inurl:8080, I found multiple publicly accessible webcams running on default ports.
Task 2 – Open Mathematics PDF Directories
Using intitle:index.of "parent directory" mathematics pdf, I located open directories containing downloadable math eBooks.
Why this matters
Shows how search engines index misconfigured devices.
Demonstrates how attackers find open directories and unsecured IoT devices.
